cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  Please cite this software, the PMC-PaIR dataset, the PMC-PaIR Data Descriptor,
  BiomedCLIP and, if you use it, the PMC-PaIR dataset construction pipeline, as
  listed under references. The code, documentation and configuration are
  released under the MIT license, and the data files and results under
  CC BY 4.0. LICENSING.md lists the paths of each class and the terms of the
  weights and of third-party material.
title: "BiomedCLIP image retrieval on PMC-PaIR"
type: software
version: "1.0.3"
license: MIT
